+++ b/scripts/quests/quest_makinghistory/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Making History — JoshRS revision-377 quest flow
+- Original dialogue and reconstruction. No Jagex dialogue or binary assets copied.
+- Cache-backed NPCs: Jorral, Droalak, Melina, Dron, Blanin, Silver Merchant and King Lathas.
+- Cache-backed quest items: enchanted key, chest, journal, scroll and the two letters.
+- Recorded progression uses permanent original %makinghistory varp with independent leads.
+- The existing Silver Merchant theft guard, shop service, King Lathas Biohazard and Underground Pass paths are preserved.
+- Quest completion requires: start prerequisites, Erin's excavated journal, Melina amulet hand-in, Droalak scroll, Blanin/Dron interview, Jorral letter, and King Lathas signed reply.
+- This initial version uses a broad **approximate Castle Wars / Observatory zone** for the buried chest rather than the exact historical tile, a shortened Dron interview and no museum scenery transition. These are outstanding fidelity gaps.
+- No desktop/user saves modified. CI only compiles/boots an isolated pinned version; full regular-client gameplay remains unverified.
