+# quest_twocats - A Tail of Two Cats (377)
+
+JoshRS-original condensed reconstruction (released 2005-07-25, Members, 2 QP).
+
+- Varp: `twocats_varbit` (cache varp id 568, made permanent by the batch-4 patch; despite the name it is a varp, not a varbit).
+- Start NPC: `twocats_unferth` (Burthorpe).
+- Chain: Unferth lends his catspeak amulet (`twocats_amuletofcatspeak`) -> find Bob (`twocats_bob_cutscene`, needs the amulet) -> Unferth demands proof -> the Sphinx (`twocats_sphinx_cutscene`) gives Bob's mouse toy (`twocats_mouse_toy`) -> return the toy to Unferth -> complete (2 QP + `twocats_rewardlamp`).
+- NOT IMPLEMENTED: Robert the Strong cutscenes, the Sphinx riddle, Unferth's chore varbits.
+- Verified against npc.pack/obj.pack names; no opnpc1 collisions for the NPCs used.
